  ('fa08d65c-f88f-4f03-bf32-b7536c561bd1', 'ecca54fb-7766-404d-9aa8-378bd965d5e5', 'e0f25697-1ae4-4634-bfce-2a2f9cc7062e', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Fourier link', 'Fourier link identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within uncertainty and compatible observables. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, fourier link carries the completed idea into angular momentum.', 2),
